│  # Madrid, Spain: 3-Day Art, History, & Culture Itinerary (Feb 14–16, 2026)                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🌟 Why Madrid?                                                                                            │
│  Madrid’s mild winter weather (12–15°C daytime, 5–8°C nighttime) with light rain on Feb 15 makes it ideal     │
│  for exploring museums and historic sites. Its art, history, and vibrant food scene align perfectly with      │
│  your interests, offering immersive cultural experiences at lower costs than Dubai.                           │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🗓️ Daily Itinerary                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### **Day 1: Feb 14 – Art & Royal Splendor**                                                                 │
│  **Weather**: Sunny, 12°C daytime, 7°C nighttime                                                              │
│  **Packing**: Light jacket, waterproof jacket, comfortable shoes                                              │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Morning**                                                                                                  │
│  - **8:30 AM**: Arrive at **Prado Museum** (€16 entry). Explore Velázquez’s *Las Meninas*, El Greco’s *View   │
│  of the Plaza Mayor*, and Goya’s *The Third of May 1808*.                                                     │
